{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107340","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1710734001:0":{"text":"에이르?! 네가 왜 여기 있어?","source_cn":"艾尔？是你？！你怎么会在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x514FBEF2ABC61208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710734002:0":{"text":"너랑 같이 있으려고 왔지!","source_cn":"是我，我在这里陪着你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB2A49A5055C8506","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710734003:0":{"text":"그런데... 여기 조금 무섭다...","source_cn":"不过……这里有点可怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x016349D5B4120FEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710734004:0":{"text":"앞에 무서운 검은 그림자들이 잔뜩 있는데... 계속 나쁜 말을 하고 있어!","source_cn":"前面有好多可怕的黑影……他们一直在说着很坏的话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x758285B2D60F9F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710734005:0":{"text":"걱정 마, 에이르! 내가 널 지켜줄게.","source_cn":"别怕，艾尔！我会用我的弓保护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFA64421C12AA07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710734006:0":{"text":"귀네스는 반사적으로 등 뒤의 장궁을 더듬었으나, 손끝에 닿은 것은 서늘한 공허뿐이었다.","source_cn":"格温妮丝下意识地反手去摸背后的长弓，却只摸到了一片虚无。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216966B15E23F0CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710734007:1":{"text":"활이... 사라졌어.","source_cn":"……弓，不见了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2ECDB60F192506E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710734008:0":{"text":"걱정 마, 귀네스! 스스로를 믿어야 해!","source_cn":"别担心！格温妮丝，一定要相信自己！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B719F2E6EAA293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710734009:0":{"text":"계속 앞을... 뚫고 지나가자!","source_cn":"一直往前走……穿过它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x279368426C26ADDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710734010:0":{"text":"네 활도, 진정한 너 자신도! 네 손으로 증명하는 거야!","source_cn":"把你的弓，和真正的自己，都找回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB93AF757361F7308","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:玩偶艾尔":{"text":"인형 에이르","source":"玩偶艾尔","status":"matched_dialo